   "en": "Se + verb talks about what people do in general, without saying who: “acá se come bien,” “se habla inglés.” If what follows is plural, the verb is plural too: se venden, se alquilan. And at a restaurant you'll need pedir, traer, and cobrar: “¿Me traés la carta?”"
